From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] proxy: add Mihomo ShadowsocksR outbound

Port Mihomo v1.19.32 SSR client protocols, obfuscation and stream ciphers.
Support TCP and native UDP through Xray's routing, socket options and
outbound chaining. Preserve protocol and obfuscation parameters.
Handle fragmented HTTP camouflage responses and reject malformed packet
lengths before slicing authenticated data.

Port source: MetaCubeX/mihomo v1.19.32 (transport/ssr and shadowstream).
Mihomo-derived code is GPL-3.0-or-later; include its license.
Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

